<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 P'es'iroosa Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">P'es'iroosi S'aafeedda Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 P'es'iroosa Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 P'es'.</para>
  <para style="mt1">P'es'iroosi</para>
  <para style="mt2">S'aafeedda Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusi kiitteedda P'es'iroosi s'aafeedda koyro kiitay s'aafetteeddawe, he kiitaa giddon «Dooretteedda S'oossaa asatuwaa» geetettiide s'eesettiyaanne K'eeri Iisiyaan huup'issa bagga shaakuwaan laaletteedda ammaniyaawanttussa. Ha kiitaa waanna k'ofay, ammanuwaa gaasuwaan metuunne waayyii gakkeeddawantta minisanaassanne mentsetsanaassa. S'aafii hawaa ootsiyaawe Aa hayk'uwaa, Aa dendduwaa, Aa laa'entso yuussaa odiyaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa nabbabiyaawantta hassayissiyaawaana. Unttunttu Yesuusi Kiristtoosa de'uwaa leemisuwaadan akkiide, metuwaa genc'c'iide aad'd'anaadan hassayissee. Hawaanna ittippe gatsiyaa wode, metuu unttunttu ammanuwaa s'alttatetsaa paac'c'iyaawaanne Yesuusi Kiristtoosi k'onc'c'iyaa gallassi unttunttu bessiyaa gatiyaa akkanaw de'iyaawaa unttuntta hassayissee.</para>
  <para style="ip">S'aafii, unttunttu metuwaan genc'c'ana mala mentsetsiyaawaa bollaakka, Kiristtoosa kaalliyaawanttu de'iyaawaadan unttunttu de'anaadan k'ofissee.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'oossaa ashshuwaabaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeyyeedda de'uwaa de'anaadan imetteedda mak'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13—2:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Metuwaa wode ammaniyaa Asay ootsana bessiyaa aawotetsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11—4:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniyaa asaa ashikketetsaanne oosuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetsaa k'utiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Taani, Yesuusi Kiristtoosi kiitteedda P'es'iroosi, S'oossay dooreedda asatoo P'ans's'oosa gadiyaan, Galaatiyaa gadiyaan, K'ap'p'adook'iyaa gadiyaan, Iisiyaa biittaaninne Biitaaniyaa gadiyaan betiyaan de'iyaawanttoo dabddaabbiyaa s'aafay. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Yesuusi Kiristtoosaw hintte azazettana malanne Aa suutsan geeyyana mala, S'oossay Aawuu dooreedda hinttenttoo bare Ayyaanan geeshsheeddawanttoo, aad'd'o keekatetsaynne sarotetsay gido.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">De'uwaa Immana Geedda Hidootaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Nuuni S'oossaa, nu Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa Aawuwaa, bare maarotetsaa daruwaadankka nuuna laa'entsuwaa yeleeddawaa, Yesuusi Kiristtoosa hayk'uwaappe dentseeddawaan nuw de'uwaa hidootaa immeeddawaa galateetto. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />K'ay S'oossay hinttenttoo immana daro laatay wook'k'ennawe, bayennawenne d'ayennawe saluwaan naagee. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Hewekka hinttenttoo, S'oossaa wolk'k'aan ammanuwaan naagetti uttiide, atotetsaw giigeeddawanttoo wurssetsaa wodiyaan k'onc'c'anawaa.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ha"i guutsaa wodew haray atto dumma dumma paac'iyaan hintte paac'ettanaw koshshooppekka, hawaan daro nashettite. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Hewe haray atto, tamaan yeggina d'ayiyaa work'k'aappekka hintte ammanuu daro al"onne bali bayinnawaa gidiyaawaa bessanaassa; yaatiide Yesuusi Kiristtoosi beettiyaa wode, galataa, bonchchuwaanne sabaa hintte akkana. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8-9" />Hintte Aa erana d'ayooppekka, siik'iita; hintte ha"i Aa be'ana d'ayooppekka, ammaniita. K'ay hintte hintte ammanoo polo gidiyaa hintte shemppuwaa atotetsaa akkiyaa diraw, odanaw danddayettenna bonchchuu kumeedda nashechchaa nashettiita.<verse eid="1PE 1:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />S'oossay hinttenttoo immana aad'd'o keekatetsaabaw timbbitiyaa odeedda nabatuu loytsi biddiide, ha atotetsaabaa koyyeeddino. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Unttunttun de'iyaa Kiristtoosa Ayyaanay Kiristtoosa tuggaabaanne hewaappe guyyiyaan yaana bonchchuwaabaa kasetiide markkattiidde, awude woy waaneedda wodiyaan yaanenttonne akeekisseeddawaadan, unttunttu koyyeeddino. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />He timbbitiyaa odiyaawanttu ootseedda oosuu hinttessappe attin, unttunttu huup'iyaassa gidennawaa S'oossay unttunttoo k'onc'c'isseedda; ha"i hintte siseedda mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa hinttenttoo odeedda asatuu, barew saluwaappe kiitetteedda Geeshsha Ayaanaa wolk'k'an odeeddino. Hewaa kiitanchchatuukka be'anaw amottiino.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Geeshshatetsaan De'iyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Hewaa diraw, oosuwaa ootsanaw hintte wozanaan k'ofaa giigissiidde hintte huup'iyaa naagite. Yesuusi Kiristtoosi k'onc'c'iyaa wode aad'd'o keekatetsaa hintte akkiyaa diraw, kumentsaa hidootaan naagite. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />S'oossaw azazettiyaa naanaadan; hintte kase erennaan amotteedda amuwaa kaalloppite. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15-16" />Shin hinttena s'eeseedda S'oossay geeshsha gideeddawaadan, hinttekka hintte oosuwaa ubbaan geeshsha gidite. S'oossaa Mas'aafan, «Taani geeshsha gidiyaa diraw, hinttekka geeshsha gidite» geetettiide s'aafetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Wog. 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Asaa huup'iyaan huup'iyaan deemuwaa s'eellennan Aa oosuwaadan pirddiyaa S'oossaa woossiidde hintte, «Nu Aabboo» giide Aa s'eesiyaawaa gidooppe, ha alamiyaan bete gidiide hintte de'iyaa wodiyaan yashshatetsaan de'ite. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18-19" />Hintte hintte aawotuwaappe laatteedda patsenna de'uwaappe wozetteeddawe, d'ayiyaa biraa woy work'k'aa malaana gidennawaa eriita; borisiyaabay woy k'itay bayinna dorssaa suutsaadan, al"o Kiristtoosa suutsan hintte wozetteeddita. <verse eid="1PE 1:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />S'oossay sa'ay med'ettanaappe kase Kiristtoosa doori wotseedda; shin hintte diraw, ha wodiyaa wurssetsaan I beetteedda. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Hintte ammanuunne hintte akkana giide nashechchan naagi utteeddabay S'oossaan de'ana mala, S'oossay hayk'uwaappe Aa dentsiide, aw bonchchuwaa immeeddawaa aan ammaniita.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Tumatetsaw hintte azazettiyaawan, lo"a malatiyaa iitatetsay bayinnaan hintte ishatuwaa siik'anaw hintte huup'iyaa geeshshiide, ittuu ittuwaanna minisiide wozanaappe siik'ettite.<verse eid="1PE 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Hintte hayk'k'iyaa zeretsaappe laa'entsuwaa yelettibeykkita; shin med'inaw de'iyaawaanne sintsawukka de'ana S'oossaa k'aalaan hayk'k'enna zeretsaappe yeletteeddita. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Asay ubbay maataa mala; Aa bonchchuu ubbaykka maataa c'iishshaa mala. Maatay melee; c'iishshaykka k'ok'k'ofettee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa. 40:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Shin Godaa k'aalay med'inaw de'ee» yaagee. Hawe hinttenttoo Goday odeedda mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">De'uwaa Shuchchaanne Geeshsha Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Hewaa diraw, hintteppe iitatetsaa ubbaa, c'immiyaawaa ubbaa, lo"a malatiyaa iitatetsaa, k'anaatiyaanne zigirssaa ubbaa diggite. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2-3" />Goday keeka gideeddawaa hintte de'uwaan be'eeddawaa gidooppe, ha"i yeletteedda gac'ino naanatuwaadan, ushiidde dic'c'anawunne attanaw s'illo gideedda ayaanaa maatsaa laamotite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Maz. 34:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Godaakko de'o shuchchaakko shiik'ite. Asay Aa is's'eedda; shin S'oossaa matan I dooretteedda al"o. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Hinttekka k'ay de'o shuchchaadan, geeshsha k'eesaa gidiide, Yesuusi Kiristtoosa baggana S'oossaa nashechchiyaa ayaanaa yarshshuwaa S'oossaw yarshshanaw, hintte hintte huup'ew ayaana keetsaadan kees'ettite. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Be'ite, taani S'iyoone giyaa katamaan golliyaa godaa s'ap'uwaa minisiyaa, dooretteedda, al"o shuchchaa wotsay; aan ammaniyaa ooninne yeellatenna» yaagee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Hewaa diraw, ha shuchchay hinttenttoo ammaniyaawanttoo daro al"a; shin ammanennawanttoo, «Gimbbiyaawanttu kad'eedda shuchchay godaa s'ap'uwaa minisiyaa, ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa shuchchaa gideedda» yaagee. <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />K'aykka, «Ha shuchchay asaa d'ubbiyaa shuchchaanne asaa kunddissiyaa zaallaa» yaagee; unttunttu S'oossaa k'aalaa ammanenna diraw, unttunttoo kasenna k'ofetteeddawaadan d'ubetteeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa. 8:14-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Shin S'oossay d'umaappe maalalissiyaa bare poo'oo hinttena s'eeseedda; hintte Aa ooratsa oosuwaa odanaw dooretteedda zare; hintte kaatiyaa k'eesatuwaa; geeshsha asanne S'oossaw buzo asaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kes. 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isa. 43:20</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zar. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit. 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Hintte kase S'oossaa asaa gidikkita; shin ha"i hintte Aa asaa; hintte kase maarotetsaa akkibeykkita; shin ha"i maarotetsaa akkeeddita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Ayilatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ta dabbatoo, hintte ha sa'aan imatsaanne bete gidiide de'iyaawantta gideeddawaadan, ubbaa wode hintte shemppuwaanna olettiyaa asatetsaa amuwaappe hintte haakkana mala, taani hinttena woossay. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Amanenna Asay hinttena iitabaa ootsiyaawanttudan zigiriyaa wode, Kiristtoosi yiyaa gallassi hintte lo"o oosuwaa unttunttu akeekiide, S'oossaa galatana mala, hintte de'uwaa unttunttu giddon loytsi naagite.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Godaa diraw, asaa higgiyaa ubbaw moodettite; kaatiikka ubbaappe bolla gidiyaa diraw, aw moodettite. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />K'ay gadiyaa mooddiyaawanttookka moodettite. Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu iitabaa ootsiyaawantta muranawunne lo"obaa ootsiyaawantta galatanaw kaatiyaappe kiitetteeddino. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay hintte hintte lo"o oosuwaan kad'iyaa eeyaa asatuwaa haasayaa c'o"u udanawaa koyyee. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ayiletetsaappe kesiide, S'oossaa ayiliyaadan de'iteppe attin, he ayiletetsaappe keseeddawaa iitatetsaa gentsiyaawaa ootsoppite. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Asaa ubbaa bonchchite. Hintte ishatuwaa siik'ite. S'oossaw yayyite. Kaatiyaa bonchchite.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Gakkeedda Metuwaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ayilatoo, hintte lo"o godatuwaa s'alalawunne ashikke godatuwaa s'alalaw gidennaan, iitatookka daro yayyiide moodettite. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ayaw gooppe, Asay naak'k'iyaa wode waayettiyaa uray S'oossaa k'oppiide, oge baynnaan naak'ettooppe S'oossay Aa anjjana. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ayaw gooppe, hintte nagaraa ootsina, hinttena dechchiyaa wode, hintte danddayooppe, hinttenttoo ay galatay de'ii? Shin lo"obaa ootsiide waayiyaa hintte danddayooppe, S'oossay hinttena hewoo anjjana. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />S'oossay hinttena s'eeseeddawe hewaa diraassa; ayaw gooppe, Kiristtoosi hinttenttoo waayettee; hintte Aa k'atamaa kaallana mala, hinttenttoo leemisuwaa gideedda. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Nagaraa I ootsibeenna; bare doonaappe wordduwaa haasayibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa. 53:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Asay barena boriyaa wode, zaariide boribeenna; waayettiyaa wodekka manddibeenna. Shin s'illuwaa pirddiyaa S'oossaw barena aatsiide immeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Nuuni nagaraw hayk'k'iide, s'illotetsaw de'ana mala, Kiristtoosi bare huup'ew bare ashuwaan nu nagaraa mask'k'aliyan tookkeedda; hintte Aa maytsaan pas'eeddita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa. 53:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ayaw gooppe, hintte ogii baleedda dorssaa mala; shin ha"i hintte shemppuwaa heemmiyaawaakkonne naagiyaawaakko simmeeddita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa. 53:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Asinaabaanne Machchiyaabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1-2" />Hewaadankka machchetoo, hintte asinatuwaappe S'oossaa k'aalaw azazettena ittuu ittuu de'ooppekka, hintte palumettennan, unttunttu hintte yashshatetsaanne hintte geeshsha de'uwaa be'iide s'oonettana mala, unttunttoo moodettite. <verse eid="1PE 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Hintte hintte huup'iyaa al"obaan giigissiyaawaaninne work'k'aa wotsiyaawaan woy al"o mayuwaa mayiyaawaan hinttenttu bolla bagga loytsoppite. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Shin hintte garssan k'osetteedda asatetsaa lo"otetsay S'oossaa sintsan hinttenttoo daro al"o gidiide, d'ayenna ashikkenne woppu geedda ayaanaa gido. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ayaw gooppe, hewaadan S'oossaan hidooteedda geeshsha mac'c'a asatuu beni wode barenttu asinaw moodettiide, barentta daro loytseeddino. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Hewaadan Saara Abraahaama, «Ta godaw» yaaga s'eesaadde, aw azazettaaddu; hinttekka ittibawunne yayyenaan lo"obaa ootsooppe, I naanatuwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Dom. 18:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Hewaadan asinatoo, hintte mac'c'a asatuwaana akeekan ittippe de'ite. Unttunttoo daaburanchcha asatetsay de'iyaa diraw, unttuntta bonchchite; hintte woosay d'ubettenna mala, S'oossay immeedda de'uwaa aad'd'o keekatetsaa unttunttu hinttenanna ittippe laattino.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lo"obaa Ootsiidde Metuwaa Akkiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Wurssetsaan, ubbay itti k'ofaan de'ite. Ittuu ittoo k'arettite; ishatuwaadan siik'ettite; k'ay ittuu ittoo keekiyaawanttanne hintte huup'iyaa kawushshiyaawantta gidite. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Iitaa diraw iitaa woy shek'aa diraw shek'aa zaaroppite; hewaa aggiide, S'oossay hinttenttu anjjuwaa laattanaadan hinttena s'eeseedda diraw, anjjite. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa Mas'aafay hawaadan yaagee; «De'uwaa dosiyaawenne lo"o gallassaa be'anaw koyyiyaawe oona gidooppenne bare ins's'arssan iitabaa haasayiyaawaanne wordduwaa odiyaawaa aggo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Maz. 34:12-16</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />«Iitabaa ootsiyaawaa aggiide, lo"obaa ootso; sarotetsaakka loytsi koyyonne kaallanaw baas'eto.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />«Ayaw gooppe, Godaa ayfii s'illotuwaakko s'eellee; k'ay Aa haytsay ubbaa wode unttunttu woosaw dooyaa de'ee. Shin Goday iitabaa ootsiyaawantta bare hank'k'uwaa som"iyaan s'eellee» yaagee.<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Hintte lo"obaa ootsanaw amottooppe, hinttena k'ohanawe oonee? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Shin haray atto, s'illotetsaa diraw hintte waayettooppekka, anjjetteeddawantta. Asaw yayyoppitenne hirggoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat. 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa. 8:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Shin Kiristtoosa hintte wozanaan bonchchitenne Aa hintte Godaa ootsite. S'oossay hinttenttoo hidooteedda de'oo gaasuwaa oochchiyaa oossinne zaaruwaa immanaw ubbaa wode giigi uttite; <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />shin hewaa ashikketetsaaninne yashshatetsaan ootsite. K'ay Kiristtoosan hintte de'iyaa lo"o de'uwaa iitabaa ootseeddawaadan, hintte bollan iitabaa haasayiyaa Asay bare zigiriyaawaan yeellatana mala, hintte wozanay geeshsha gido. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay geeddawaa gidooppe, iitabaa ootseedda diraw waayettiyaawaappe, lo"obaa ootseedda diraw waayettiyaawe keeka. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ayaw gooppe, Kiristtoosi nuuna S'oossaakko afanaw, barew s'illo gidiidde, makkalanchchatuwaa diraw, itti gede ubbaa nagaraw hayk'k'eedda; I bare asatetsan hayk'k'eedda; shin ayyaanan pas'eedda. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />K'ay he Ayyaanan, k'ashuwaan de'iyaa ayyaanatuwaakko biide, unttunttoo k'aalaa odeedda. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />He ayyaanatuu amareeda, hosppun asatuu haatsaan atteedda markkabiyaa Nohe kees's'ishshin, S'oossay danddayiide gam"eedda wode, S'oossaw azazettibeena asaa ayyaanatuwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Dom. 6:1—7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Hewe s'ink'k'ataw leemisuwaa gidiide, hinttena ha"i ashshee; suure wozanaappe S'oossaa woossiyaawaappe attin, bollaa k'itaa meec'c'iyaawaa gidenna; hewe hinttena Yesuusi Kiristtoosi hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaan ashshee. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Saluwaa biide S'oossaappe ushechcha baggan I uttiide, kiitanchchaa ubbaa, maataanna de'iyaawanttanne wolk'k'aamatuwaa mooddee.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Geeshshatetsaan De'ana De'uwaabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Hewaa diraw, Kiristtoosi bare ashuwaan nuw waayetteedda diraw, hinttekka he k'ofaan danc'c'ettite. Ayaw gooppe, bare ashuwaan waayetteedda uray nagaraa ootsiyaawaa aggeedda. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Hawaappe sintsan, ha sa'aan shemppuwaanna de'anaw atteedda wodiyaan, S'oossay koyyiyaawaadan de'anaw bessiyaawaappe attin, asaa amuwaadan de'anaw bessena. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ayaw gooppe, ammanenna Asay ootsanaw dosiyaawaa hintte ootsiidde, woshummanaw kajjeeliyaawaan, amuwaan, matsuwaan, yetsaan, ushshaan, pokkiyaa eek'aw goyinniyaawan, de'eedda kase aad'd'eedda wodii hinttenttoo gidanawaa. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ammanenna asaana hintte shoray bayinna oosuwaa ittippe ootsenna diraw maalalettiide, hinttena boriino. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Shin unttunttu pas'a de'iyaa asaa bollanne hayk'k'eedda asaa bolla pirddanaw giigi utteedda S'oossaw zaaruwaa immana. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Hayk'k'eedda asay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hayk'k'eedda asay: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa ammananaappe kasenna hayk'k'eeddawantta woy Nohe wode asatuwaa. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 3:19">3:19</ref></char> s'eellite.</note> bare asatetsan Asay pirddettiyaawaadan pirddettanawunne k'ay ayyaanan S'oossay de'iyaawaadan de'anaw, wonggalaa mishiraachchuu unttunttoo hewoo odetteedda.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossay Immeedda Imotatuwaa Loytsi Ayissiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Ubbabawukka wurssetsay matatteedda. Hewaa diraw, S'oossaa woossanaw k'ofaan geeyyiide, hinttena naagitenne minnite. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Siik'uu daro nagaraa kammiyaa diraw, ubbabaappe aatsiide ittuu ittuwaanna wozanaappe siik'ettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Lem. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Zuuzummennan ittuu ittuwaa imatsatetsaan mokkite. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Hintte huup'iyaan huup'iyaan S'oossaappe dumma dumma aad'd'o keekatetsaa akkeeddawaadankka, S'oossaa dumma imuwaa hadaraa loytsi kesiyaawanttudan, ittuu ittoo ootsite. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Yesuusi Kiristtoosa baggana ubbabaan S'oossay galatettana mala, ooninne odiyaawaa gidooppe, k'aalaa S'oossaappe akkiide odiyaawaadan odo. K'ay ooninne maaddiyaawaa gidooppe, S'oossay aw immiyaa wolk'k'an maaddo. Bonchchuunne godatetsay S'oossaw med'inaappe med'inaw gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Metuwaa Wode Minniyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ta siik'atoo, hintte giddon tamaadan guuddiidde paac'c'iyaa waayyii yiyaawaa ooratsabay haniyaawaadan malalettoppite. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Shin Kiristtoosa bonchchuu beettiyaa wode hintte nashettana mala, aanana waayettiyaawaan nashetite. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Asay hinttena Kiristtoosa suntsaa diraw boriyaawaa gidooppe, hintte anjjetteeddawantta; ayaw gooppe, bonchcho Ayyaanay, S'oossaa Ayyaanay, hintte bolla shemppana. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Hintteppe ooninne shemppuwaa wod'eeddawaadan, woy kayisuwaadan, woy iitabaa ootseedda asaadan, woy hara asaa yewuwaa geleeddawaadan waayettoppo. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Shin ooninne Kiristtaaniyaa gidiyaa diraw waayettooppe, Kiristtoosa suntsaa diraw, S'oossaa galatanaappe attin, yeellatoppo.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ayaw gooppe, pirdday S'oossaa golliyaan doomettiyaa wodii gakkeedda. K'ay he pirdday koyiro nu bolla doomettiyaawaa gidooppe, Aa wonggalaw azazettenawanttu wurssetsay ayaa gidanee? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />S'illo Asay tuggaan attiyaawaa gidooppe, makkalanchchaynne nagaranchchay yaatina waananee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Lem. 11:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Hewaa diraw k'ay, S'oossay geeddawaadan waayettiyaawanttu lo"obaa ootsiidde, barenttu shemppuwaa hadaraa barena med'd'eedda ammanettiyaa S'oossaw immino.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Asaa Ayissanaw Imetteedda Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Simmi taani woosa golliyaa c'imatuwaanna c'ima gidiyaawenne, Kiristtoosa waayiyaa markkattiyaawe, k'ay k'onc'c'ana bonchchuwaa shaakkanawe hintte giddon de'iyaa c'imatuwaa zoray. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Hintte giddon de'iyaa S'oossaa wudiyaa S'oossay koyyiyaawaadan heemmite. Dosuwaanappe attin, wolk'k'an gidenna. K'ay hintte go"a s'alalaa s'eellennan, lo"o k'ofaan heemmite. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Wudew hintte leemisuwaa giditeppe attin, hintte heemmiyaawantta wolk'k'aan heemmoppite. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />K'ay heemmiyaawanttu kaappuu k'onc'c'iyaa wode, bayenna bonchcho kalachchaa hintte akkana.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Hewaadankka yalaga asatoo, c'imatoo moodettite. Ubbaykka ittuu ittoo ootsanaw hintte huup'iyaa kawushshiyaawaa afilaadan mayyite. Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay otorettiyaawantta is's'ee; shin barena kawushshiyaawanttoo aad'd'o keekatetsaa immee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Lem. 3:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />S'oossay bare lo"o wodiyaan hinttena d'ok'k'u ootsana mala, wolk'k'aama S'oossaa kushiyaappe garssanna hinttena toochchite. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />I hinttenttoo k'oppiyaa diraw, hinttena hirggissiyaa ubbabaa Aa bolla olite.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />S'alahiyaa kaappuu, hintte morkkii, mittiyaa uraa koyyiide, gudiyaa gaammuwaadan hintte yuushshuwaan yuuyyiyaa diraw naagettitenne beegottite. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Sa'aan de'iyaa hintte ishatuu hewaadan waayettiyaawaa eriide, ammanuwaan minniide, aanana ek'ettite. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Aad'o keekatetsaa ubbaa S'oossay, bare med'inaa bonchchoo Kiristtoosi Yesuusa baggana hinttena s'eeseeddawe, amareeda wodiyaa hintte waayetteeddawaappe guyyiyaan, I bare huup'ew hinttena shiri ooratsananne minisana. K'ay I hinttena maaddananne baasi essana. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Wolk'k'ay med'inaappe med'inaa gakkanaw aw gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Hawe S'oossaa tumu aad'd'o keekatetsaa gidiyaawaa taani hinttenttoo markkattaaddenne hinttena zoraadde, hinttenttoo k'antsaan s'aafeedda dabddaabbiyaa ammanettiyaa ishaa gaade taani k'oppiyaa Sillaase bolla kiittaad; he aad'd'o keekatetsan minneeddita.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Hinttenana ittippe dooretteedda Baabloonen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baabloone: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sas'aa Mas'aafaa k'ofaadan, ha suntsay Roome guussaa gidennaan aggena.</char></note> de'iyaa woosa golliyaa asaynne ta na'ay Mark'k'oossi hinttena «Saro saro» giino. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Siik'uwaa yeretaa yerettiidde, ittuu ittuwaa sarotite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Hinttew, Kiristtoosanna ittuwaa gideeddawanttoo ubbatoo sarotetsay gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>